<section id="build" class="clips-section build-section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">What Prova is building</p>
    <h2>A trust layer for the social feed</h2>
    <p class="muted">Prova combines quick prompts, AI detection, community signals, and habit-building tools so young people can verify content before it spreads.</p>
    <div class="clip-grid">
      <div class="clip-card blur">
        <div class="clip-media">Verification Prompts</div>
        <div class="clip-meta">
          <h4>Pause for 2–3 seconds</h4>
          <p class="muted">Guiding questions like “Is the source credible?” help people slow down and think before they share.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="clip-card blur">
        <div class="clip-media">AI & ML Detection</div>
        <div class="clip-meta">
          <h4>Spot deepfakes and bias</h4>
          <p class="muted">Instantly flags manipulated media, political slant, and algorithmic influence in the feed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="clip-card blur">
        <div class="clip-media">Social Companion</div>
        <div class="clip-meta">
          <h4>Track your feed habits</h4>
          <p class="muted">A lightweight companion helps people understand what they consume and how to reduce misinformation exposure.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="clip-card blur">
        <div class="clip-media">Gamified learning</div>
        <div class="clip-meta">
          <h4>Earn badges for good habits</h4>
          <p class="muted">Points, challenges, and titles make spotting false content a social habit, not a chore.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="clip-card blur center-card">
        <div class="clip-media">Inclusive access</div>
        <div class="clip-meta">
          <h4>Built for young people</h4>
          <p class="muted">Clear, fast signals made for the way Gen Z actually scrolls, shares, and learns online.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
